    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like restlessness though. it feels more like... completion. like the book is finished and i've reached the last page. i keep thinking about how i worked so hard just to get to this point, and now that i'm here, there's nowhere else to go. nothing left to strive for. what's even the point of keeping the momentum going when the summit is just... nothing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
